# convert-service build context exclusions.
#
# Separate from the repo-root .dockerignore because this service builds with
# `context: ./convert-service` — Docker reads the ignore file from the CONTEXT
# directory, so the root one does not apply here.
#
# Unlike capture-service/.dockerignore this file does NOT exclude `tests`.
# `docker compose run --rm convert-service pytest` is how the service is proved
# to work (convert-service/README.md §5), and the fixtures under tests/fixtures
# are the input to the conversion tests, the parity script and the benchmark.
# pytest itself is installed by the Dockerfile for the same reason.

.venv
venv
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.env
.env.local
